# src/substrate-tus.manifest: the exhaustive set of bare-src/ substrate .c files (G4).
# Every tracked src/*.c that is NOT under src/protocols/ must be listed here. A new bare-src
# .c fails check-protocol-home until it is declared substrate here OR moved under
# src/protocols/<fam>/; that is the default-deny that stops a protocol impl landing at bare src/.
# Regenerate intentionally: git ls-files 'src/*.c' | grep -vE '^src/protocols/' | LC_ALL=C sort
